    <p><span><span>This value can then be plugged into the ICE Table to obtain equilibrium values for \(\ce{I_{2\, (aq)}} \) and \(\ce{I_{2} (CCl_4)}\). (Remember that the two liquids are immiscible so the molarity isn't \( 0.125 \text{M}\) as \(\ce{I_{2} (CCl_4)}\) does not contribute to the initial molarity of the solution.)</span></span></p>

