    <p><span>Use: P<sub>gas</sub> = n<sub>gas</sub>(RT/V)</span></p>

    <p><span>K = P<sub>Br2</sub><sub> </sub>/ P<sup>2</sup><sub>NOBr</sub><sub> </sub>= n<sub>Br2</sub> / n<sup>2</sup><sub>NOBr</sub><sub> </sub>= 5.44 x 10<sup>-5 </sup></span></p>

    <p><span>The volume is needed to solve this problem. It is necessary to find the value of K regardless of it is K<sub>p</sub> or K<sub>c</sub>.</span></p>
